<title>USA: Dow index off more than 50 points.</title>
<headline>Dow index off more than 50 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 50 points in early trading Friday following a broad selloff in technology stocks.</p>
<p>At 10:07 a.m. EDT, the Dow was off 50.87 points at 7,969.90, which activated the New York Stock Exchange's limits on program trading.</p>
